--------------------------------------------------------------------------
--  XENOTECH UI
--  A from-scratch interface toolkit for the Photon render/input API.
--
--  Aesthetic pass: alien-tech / far-future HUD. Every panel is a
--  chamfered (cut-corner) plate instead of a rounded rectangle,
--  focus states are drawn as targeting-reticle corner brackets,
--  toggles are glowing hex power-cells, sliders are energy conduits
--  with traveling particles, and the whole window sits inside a
--  faint scan-grid with an animated sweep line and a soft energy
--  halo. Theming is still a tweened, clickable swatch gallery.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

